          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko muri ico gihe ishami ry’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " rizokwambikwa ubwiza n’ugukayangana, kandi amasigarira y’Abisirayeli azokwishimira yongere anezererwe ivyamwa vyo mu gihugu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abazoba basigaye i Siyoni, bakaguma i Yerusalemu, bazokwitwa abera. Ni abazoba barokotse bakaba banditswe mu gitabu c’abazima i Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imana izokwoza imyanda y’abakobwa b’i Siyoni, ihanagure amaraso yasesekeye i Yerusalemu ikoresheje impwemu y’urubanza n’impwemu y’umuriro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku murango, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " azorema igicu kibe hejuru y’umusozi Siyoni hamwe n’abahakoranira bose, mw’ijoro na ho aharemere imbeya z’umuriro. Icubahiro ciwe kizoba hejuru ya vyose nk’ihema rinini rihapfutse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kizoba ubwugamo n’igitutu mu bushuhe bwo ku murango, n’ubuhungiro n’ubwihisho mu gihe c’igihuhusi n’imvura.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
